  * gcc.dg/vect, -O3 -march=native, built and run:
        730 pass, 0 NEW failures (11 pre-existing).
        -> 2824 executed tests, zero new failures.
  * Compile sweeps vs the control:
        gcc.dg/vect        1949 files: 0 ICEs, 0 differences
        gcc.target/i386    2318 files: 0 ICEs, 0 differences
        gcc.dg/torture     1147 files: 0 ICEs, 0 differences
    i.e. the change is inert on 5414 testsuite files and only fires on
    the idiom it targets.
  * cc1/cc1plus rebuilt RC=0 with no new warnings.

REGRESSION TEST

  gcc/testsuite/gcc.target/i386/ms178-fp-clamp-1.c - verified to pass
