  * gcc.dg/vect, -O3 -march=native, built and run:
        1167 pass, 0 NEW failures (11 pre-existing).
  * Compile sweeps vs the control:
        gcc.dg/vect      1949 files: 0 ICEs, 1 file differs
                         (vect-bitfield-read-3, which now vectorizes one
                          more loop and still passes at runtime)
        gcc.target/i386  2019 files: 0 ICEs, 3 files differ by <=1 insn
                         (avx-vpcmpestrm-1/-2, avx-vpcmpistrm-1; both
                          executables verified to still run correctly)
        Mesa standalone   204 files: 0 ICEs, 1 file differs
        Mesa amd+nir       48 files: 0 ICEs, 4 files differ, all gains
  * cc1 and cc1plus rebuilt RC=0 with no new warnings.

